{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>בראשית ברא</b> in gematria: בראש השנה נברא (the world was created on Rosh HaShanah). בראשית as notarikon: בראשונה ראה אלהים שיקבלו ישראל תורה (at the beginning Elohim saw that Israel would accept the Torah). בראשית ברא אלהים — ס\"ת אמת, teaches that He created the world with truth, as stated: ראש דברך אמת. And similarly there are many verses whose ס\"ת is אמת."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:27.671103273Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}